hildren":["Vehicle"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Vehicle"}," or ",{"tag":"a","children":["Starship"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Starship"}," of Huge size or larger. It is used to fire Discord Missiles, with one Discord Missile fitting inside the launcher.\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["When a Discord Missile is fired, the gunner makes an attack roll against a square within the missile's ",{"tag":"a","children":["Range"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Range"}," (",{"tag":"a","children":["Reflex Defense"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Reflex_Defense"}," 10). If successful, the Discord Missile breaks open in the target square and releases three ",{"tag":"a","children":["Buzz Droids"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Buzz_Droids"}," (which appear in separate squares adjacent to the target square). At ",{"tag":"a","children":["Starship Scale"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Starship_Scale"},", when the missile breaks open, it fills the target square with its ",{"tag":"a","children":["Buzz Droids"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Buzz_Droids"},". When a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Vehicle"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Vehicle"}," enters a square occupied by one or more ",{"tag":"a","children":["Buzz Droids"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Buzz_Droids"},", the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Buzz Droids"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Buzz_Droids"}," can make an immediate ",{"tag":"a","children":["Melee Attack"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Melee_Attack"}," as a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Reaction"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Reaction"}," against the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Vehicle"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Vehicle"}," with an additional +5 ",{"tag":"a","children":["Equipment"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Equipment","referenceId":"reference:7f2465ac7cefab27"}," bonus to their attack rolls. If the attack succeeds, the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Buzz Droid"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Buzz_Droid","referenceId":"reference:d1a5a7fc341eb6de"}," latches onto the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Vehicle"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Vehicle"}," and automatically moves when the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Vehicle"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Vehicle"}," moves.\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["Standard ",{"tag":"a","children":["Starship"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Starship"}," missile weapons have 20 ",{"tag":"a","children":["Hit Points"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Hit_Points","referenceId":"reference:58e8ee2c9538d027"}," and DR 10 each; when a missile is reduced to 0 ",{"tag":"a","children":["Hit Points"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Hit_Points","referenceId":"reference:58e8ee2c9538d027"},", its munitions explode dealing normal damage to any objects or characters within a 4-Square ",{"tag":"a","children":["Burst"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Burst"}," radius.\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"table","children":["\n",{"tag":"caption","children":["Discord Missile Ranges\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"tbody","children":[{"tag":"tr","children":["\n",{"tag":"th","children":["RANGE BY CHARACTER SCALE\n"],"colspan":4},"\n",{"tag":"th","children":["\n"],"rowspan":3},"\n",{"tag":"th","children":["\n",{"tag":"p","children":["RANGE BY STARSHIP SCALE\n"]},"\n"],"colspan":4}]},"\n",{"tag":"tr","children":["\n",{"tag":"th","children":["POINT-BLANK\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"th","children":["SHORT\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"th","children":["MEDIUM\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"th","children":["LONG\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"th","children":["POINT-BLANK\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"th","children":["SHORT\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"th","children":["MEDIUM\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"th","children":["LONG\n"]}]},"\n",{"tag":"tr","children":["\n",{"tag":"td","children":["0-450 Squares\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":["451-900 Squares\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":["901-2,250 Squares\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":["2,251-4,500 Squares\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","